<h3><u>zinda rahe</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>zinda rahe - 3<br />
ay azaadaare hussaini ye chalan zinda rahe<br />
haan azaakhaane sajaane ki lagan zinda rahe - 2</p>

<p>jab azaakhaana saje to dil bane farshe azaa<br />
dharhkanon me maatame shaahe zamaan zinda rahe</p>

<p>nohakhwaan maatam ke saaye me safar karte rahen<br />
har bayaaze gham khule har anjuman zinda rahe</p>

<p>roze aashura juluse gham ko kya raahat se kaam<br />
yaad me pyaase aseeron ki thakan zinda rahe</p>

<p>ay azaadaaro chalo mashk o alam ke saaye me<br />
ye tajammul ye hasham ye baakpan zinda rahe</p>

<p>jis jagaah thi maut aasaan zindagi dushwaar thi<br />
haa wahaan zehra ke saare gulbadan zinda rahe</p>

<p>sab azaakhaane hamaare sab hi apni majlisein<br />
ay dua e sayyada ye apna pan zinda rahe</p>

<p>chote chote se alam bachhon ke haathon me rahe<br />
dil me taabute sakina ki chubhan zinda rahe</p>

<p>kar rahe hain ye dua zere alam sarwar hilaal<br />
ay khuda ye gham ba faize panjetan zinda rahe</p>
</p>